.TH "SPGEN-VIEW" "1" "" "spgen 0.1.0" ""
.SH NAME
spgen\-view \- Generates the JSON:API view for a read model
.SH SYNOPSIS
mix sp.gen.view [options] <READ\-MODEL>
.SH DESCRIPTION
The JSON:API representation of a read model: its type, its path, its attributes.
.SH Prerequisite
.IP \[bu] 2
The Domain Model (../../../../domain\-model/README.md) contains the read model the endpoint returns.
.SH "What the generator does"
use JSONAPI.View with the singular JSON:API type, path/0 from the subdomain/composite/constituent route shape, and fields/0 from the read model's schema — id and the timestamps are excluded, they are not attributes. The @moduledoc and the @docs follow the model.
.PP
The view is the read model's face: a field that should not be public is removed from the read model, not hidden here, and an attribute or include the model does not express as a field starts there, not in the view.
.SH Tests
Its own file, <domain_object>_view_test.exs, generated with the view: type/0, fields/0, path/0 and a render("show.json", …) document assertion. Add an assertion when you add a field the model states.
.SS "Generated files"
.IP \[bu] 2
services/api/lib/sportipedia_web/<_subdomain>/<composite>/<domain_object>/<domain_object>_view.ex (JSON:API rendering per field)
.IP \[bu] 2
services/api/test/sportipedia_web/<_subdomain>/<composite>/<domain_object>/<domain_object>_view_test.exs (render tests against fixtures)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-subdomain\fR \fI<SUBDOMAIN>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-composite\fR \fI<COMPOSITE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-constituent\fR \fI<CONSTITUENT>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODEL>\fR
model root, default docs/domain\-model (relative to \-\-root)
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR
repo root, default inferred from the current directory
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
report the drift, write nothing
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-force\fR
FE: rewrite present generated units in place
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREAD\-MODEL\fR>
the element: esdm: reference, *.esdm.yaml, kind.name, or bare name
.SH "SEE ALSO"
spgen(1)
suites: endpoint, feature
